# The credential shapes the fork's guards refuse, one place for both hooks:
# .githooks/pre-commit reads the lines a commit would add, .githooks/pre-push
# reads every line every pushed commit added. A placeholder in <angle brackets>
# never matches by construction -- every pattern demands a real-looking value.
# A test fixture for a scanner is built at run time (printf pieces), never
# written as a literal (2026-09-28, #307: three fixtures a fix stream wrote
# reached history and the range had to be rewritten to push).
